    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "span",
      "cls": "n",
      "text": "01"
    },
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "SEO on local store pages"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "“Identify and make recommendations to further optimize key pages, including homepage, category pages, product pages, vendor pages, content pages, local store pages."
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "span",
      "cls": "n",
      "text": "02"
    },
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "You already serve it"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "/stores/ returns 268 active stores with address, city, state, zip and phone. A template turns each into an indexable page with hours, departments, a map and LocalBusiness schema — capturing “Dunham's + city” and “near me”."
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "span",
      "cls": "n",
      "text": "03"
    },
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "Consolidate the catalog"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "301 the 41 “-1/-2” duplicates to clean slugs, generate unique metadata for 1,764 categories, add Product schema, and give the sitemap real lastmod values instead of one bulk-stamped date."
    },
